            "review_text": "Maxie Peel\n1 contribution\n0\nHighly recommended\nOct 2024 • Family\nThe menu was a fantastic blend of traditional Vietnamese flavors and fresh seafood. I opted for the grilled squid and the pho, and both dishes were outstanding! The squid was perfectly cooked, tender, and bursting with flavor, while the pho had that comforting richness that left me craving more.\n\nThe staff were incredibly friendly and attentive, making sure my experience was nothing short of perfect. They were knowledgeable about the menu and offered great recommendations.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 14, 2024",
