            "review_text": "Andy Barnes\nSutton, United Kingdom2650 contributions\n0\nExcellent meal and outstanding staff\nMay 2024 • Couples\nWe just had an evening meal at this lovely restaurant.\nTo start off with the location is brilliant. Right on the edge of the beach the most amazing view of the sunset.\nThe staff are amazing and could not be more attentive if they tried.\nThe menu is varied but mainly centred around seafood.\n\nI don’t like seafood so I had the lamb which was absolutely delicious. \nMy partner had to seafood special which was six courses of different types of seafood.\nThe meal was absolutely delicious and I would highly recommend. It’s not cheap but thoroughly worth it.\nRead more\nWritten May 22, 2024",
