            "review_title": "Review at Ocean Club",
            "review_text": "George Carter\nBerkhamsted, United Kingdom4 contributions\n1\nOcean club!\nJan 2024 • Family\nHad lunch over a few days here and dinner one evening. A great restaurant in a great hotel overlooking the beach. Top class service from the staff with a special mention to ‘Sharky’ who was great and always smiling! We will be coming back.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 10, 2024\nRegentphuquoc\nDear georgecarter4,\n\nThank you for taking the time to share your positive review of our Ocean Club. We are delighted to hear that you had an amazing dining experience with a beautiful beach view and attentive colleagues. Your kind recognition of Mr. Sharky's warm hospitality is greatly appreciated, and we will make sure to pass on your comment to commend his excellent service.\n\nWe appreciate your kind words, and we would be thrilled to welcome you back to Ocean Club and Regent Phu Quoc in the near future.\n\nWarm Regards,\n\nSriram Kailasam\nGeneral Manager\nRead more\nWritten March 1, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
