            "review_text": "craigriley1969\nColne, United Kingdom28 contributions\n0\nBeautiful pool restaurant\nNov 2023 • Couples\nHad a fantastic evening meal and lunch at the ocean club, beautiful restaurant in a lovely setting. All meals were delicious and the service was excellent. Although we were staying at the hotel next door to the Regent we were made to feel very welcome.\nWritten November 23, 2023\nRegentphuquoc\nDear craigriley1969,\n\nThank you for taking the time to share your wonderful review of Ocean Club. We are thrilled to hear that you had a fantastic dining experience with us. It brings us great joy to receive such positive feedback about the delicious food and the quality of service we strive to provide.\n\nWe truly appreciate your kind review, and we would be honored to welcome you as a staying guest in the future, where you can experience our full range of services.\n\nWarm Regards,\n\nSriram Kailasam\nGeneral Manager\nRead more\nWritten March 1, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
