            "review_title": "Review at Ocean Club",
            "review_text": "1978\nCotswolds, United Kingdom68 contributions\n0\nSuperb winter sun getaway\nDec 2022 • Couples\nWe spent a week in this little resort. It’s beautiful. The private beach is immaculate,. Always a free sun lounger as despite the most perfect beach, most people prefer the pool (also lovely but we didn’t use it). \n\nPool bar staff all insist on bringing your orders to you on the beach! The staff couldn’t be more inviting and helpful. A lady with glasses served us on the beach all week with big smiles. \n\nThe only thing lacking is the food menu but they are working on this. It is limited but the breakfast buffet is fantastic. We just wished there was the same Vietnamese food offer on the menu for the rest of the day. It’s such a minor detail though because the rest of it is superb. \n\nThere are few places left in the world where you can feel so cocooned in a peaceful haven. No beach hawkers, a fine Sandy beach and sunshine in December. Heaven… and for anyone complaining about the cost of the minibar … it’s £1 for a water, coke or beer!!!! Nothing about this resort felt too expensive for the quality of service given.\n\nBig thank you to Trung for always checking his guests are happy. I left having had a holiday I wish I could have extended by 4 months!!!\nRead more\nWritten December 10, 2022\nRegentphuquoc\nDear Catkin1978,\n\nThank you for leaving your kind comment on experience in Ocean Club. We are delighted that you had great dining experience with tasteful foods and warm smile services. \n\nWe are looking forward to welcoming you in Ocean Club again in the near future.\n\nSincerely,\n\nSriram Kailasam\nGeneral Manager\nRead more\nWritten March 7, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
